  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1470",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-11T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-11T14:09:31.230Z",
    "meteorologist": "Devid Dhakal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा माथिल्लो वायूमण्डलमा रहेको न्युनचापीय प्रणालीको प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, there is the influence of the low-pressure system in the upper atmosphere in Nepal.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागका साथै कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका साथै कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan region of the country, as well as the hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair over the remaining areas. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at one or two places in the Himalayan and hilly regions of Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan regions of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Fog/mist will occur at a few places over the Terai region, valleys and river basins during the morning.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने तथा तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागको एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan and hilly regions of the country, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the Terai region. There is a possibility of light rainfall at one or two places in the hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  },
